Starting with the geometric cuts given in \Tref{TableV0DefaultCuts}, the restrictions on the DCA of the \vzero to the primary vertex, the DCA of the daughters to each other, the DCA of the daughters to the primary vertex, the decay length, the number of TPC hits on each daughter, and the \nsigdedx for each daughter were tuned until a purity of about 95\% was reached in each centrality bin and at each momentum.  Final mass peaks are given in [cite mass peak appendix] and final geometric cuts are listed in \Aref{geocutsappendix}.  The purity is shown in \Fref{V0Purity}.

